PRIMECUBER v1.5 - SPIKE APP 3 PYTHON CONVERSION
=================================================
This file contains the Python source for the PrimeCuber v1.5 project converted
from the older SPIKE Prime device-object API to the SPIKE App 3 module-based
API.
Hardware ports used by this build:
A = Color Sensor
B = Scan motor
C = Distance Sensor
D = Turn motor
F = Tilt motor
IMPORTANT:
PrimeCuber v1.5 also uses a large binary lookup-table file (pcmtab4_v1p5.bin)
for its fastest solving mode. That binary file is NOT Python source and is not
included in this text file. Keep the original binary table from the project
when installing the full solver.
The original project was written by David Gilday. The original copyright and
non-commercial-use notice is retained in the source below.
